### Create a Maintenance Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Broken Window",
    "description": "Cracked glass in living room",
    "status": "PENDING",
    "resident": {
        "id": 1
    }
}

### Manager updates the status to IN_PROGRESS
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/maintenance/1/status
Content-Type: text/plain

IN_PROGRESS

### Resident #1 hits the SOS Button
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sos/3

### See all ongoing SOS situations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sos/active

### Manager creates a Rent bill
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1100.00,
    "type": "RENT",
    "dueDate": "2024-06-01",
    "paid": false,
    "resident": {
        "id": 1
    }
}

### Get unpaid bills for Resident #1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/resident/1/unpaid

### Mark bill as paid
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/payments/4/pay

### make parking spot avaiable = true
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parking/slot/1/availability?available=true

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mark Rober",
    "email": "mark@example.com",
    "password": "password12345",
    "role": "RESIDENT"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parking/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "startTime": "2024-06-01T10:00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-06-01T18:00:00",
    "requester": { "id": 2 },
    "slot": { "id": 1 }
}

### 1. OWNER checks for new requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking/owner/1/pending

### 2. OWNER approves the request (Change the '1' to your Request ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parking/request/1?status=APPROVED

### 3. REQUESTER checks if they got the spot
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking/requester/2/updates

### Get payments for a non-existent user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/resident/9999/unpaid

### Try to pay an already paid bill (use the ID of a paid bill, e.g., 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/payments/1/pay

### Manager creates a notice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Water Maintenance",
    "content": "Water supply will be suspended this Sunday from 9 AM to 12 PM.",
    "author": { "id": 1 }
}

### Get the notice board feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notices

### Resident tries to post a notice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "I am a Hacker",
    "content": "I shouldn't be able to post this!"
}

### Manager posts a notice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Official Notice",
    "content": "This is a legitimate manager post."
}

### Manager deletes a notice
# Replace {noticeId} with the ID of the notice (e.g., 1)
# Replace {managerId} with the ID of a user with the 'MANAGER' role (e.g., 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notices/3/3

### Resident tries to update status (Should Fail - 403 Forbidden)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/maintenance/2/status/3
Content-Type: text/plain

COMPLETED






